<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">总无法依着心意早起</text><text for="L2">匆匆咽下那根纳豆寿司卷</text><text for="L3">如同例行公事般毫无波澜的仪式</text><text for="L4">客套着道一句「承蒙关照」</text><text for="L5">翻开手账记录 便已尽数化为过往</text><text for="L6">前辈那令人无从反驳的说教逻辑</text><text for="L7">日复一日 途中漫无目的绕道闲逛便已是难得的奢靡</text><text for="L8">唯有起舞翩跹 沉醉在无人发觉的世界</text><text for="L9">在那些比双胞胎艺术家更富谐趣的街头涂鸦里</text><text for="L10">停步抛弃那所谓熬出头的苦熬正义</text><text for="L11">人生苦短 哪有闲暇去同冷嘲热讽虚耗光阴</text><text for="L12">索性全抛脑后 径直甩开离去</text><text for="L13">任那群人聚在一起开他们的同窗会</text><text for="L14">伴我身旁 顺遂自如地舒展本心</text><text for="L15">不过是一场羞怯腼腆的徒劳喧嚣</text><text for="L16">苦苦咬牙坚持的战绩 烟消云散</text><text for="L17">缠绕着憧憬之我的城市电线杆</text><text for="L18">出神发呆 潜心沉溺其中</text><text for="L19">做个由着性子的自己又有何妨</text><text for="L20">懒得去在乎 统统弃置身后</text><text for="L21">让他们大伙去扎堆叙旧寒暄吧</text><text for="L22">立于我侧 怡然自在保持真我</text><text for="L23">内敛羞涩的无谓狂欢</text><text for="L24">苦心拼搏而来的优异成绩 随风消逝</text><text for="L25">向往的理想自我 困在错综的电杆迷局</text><text for="L26">神游天外 忘我深陷其中</text><text for="L27">任性妄为的我 也自有一番模样</text><text for="L28">在这个纵然相拥也无法治愈的世界</text><text for="L29">化身为毫无姓名的隐匿之躯</text><text for="L30">即便不去无端指摘任何人</text><text for="L31">也仍在苦苦寻觅能够宣泄心绪的话语</text><text for="L32">踏着嘻哈律动的节拍踢开束缚</text><text for="L33">拭去那抹过于浓烈的深暗爱意</text><text for="L34">就算不去向谁口诛笔伐</text><text for="L35">也在不断寻找能够挥洒个性的独特风格</text><text for="L36">听不进任何金玉良言的我</text><text for="L37">虽然未必能孕育出多么惊艳的造物</text><text for="L38">但唯愿能够懂得 目之所及绝非世界的全部</text><text for="L39">仅此而已</text><text for="L40">无所谓了 尽数抛诸脑后</text><text for="L41">且随那些家伙奔赴虚饰的热闹聚会</text><text for="L42">相伴于此 坦然活出真实自我</text><text for="L43">暗自羞涩的无由躁动</text><text for="L44">苦苦支撑累积的赫赫战功 荡然无存</text><text for="L45">渴望蜕变的自我 羁绊在电线林立的街角</text><text for="L46">神思漫游 恣意沉浸忘我</text><text for="L47">纵使孤芳自赏 也足够心安理得</text><text for="L48">随它去吧 彻底拂袖离席</text><text for="L49">由他们自去温存往昔的同窗旧梦</text><text for="L50">执守身侧 毫无拘束顺其自然</text><text for="L51">一场遮掩心事的羞涩狂欢</text><text for="L52">煞费苦心争来的微薄名次 一笔勾销</text><text for="L53">理想中的模样 迷失在林立的城市脉络</text><text for="L54">放空心绪 纵情沉沦所爱</text><text for="L55">做个独断独行的自己 便已极好</text><text for="L56">贬损旁人以彰显自身的大义凛然</text><text for="L57">断章取义截取片言只字</text><text for="L58">蜂拥群起围攻 微小的误解便成致命杀机</text><text for="L59">你到底算我的什么人</text><text for="L60">我的心竟被这般货色生生撕裂</text><text for="L61">凭空臆想终究只是无根的猜忌</text><text for="L62">虽有顽强耐性 却也经不起风吹雨打</text><text for="L63">在胸膛这颗心脏卷入无谓竞逐之前</text><text for="L64">满不在乎 径直扬长而去</text><text for="L65">原来不过如此 便顺风飘然而散</text><text for="L66">全无挂碍 彻底撒手放开</text><text for="L67">任由他们全员在同窗旧梦里沉沦</text><text for="L68">陪伴在侧 舒展率性真容</text><text for="L69">内敛少年的一枕繁华</text><text for="L70">曾经呕心沥血的战绩 尽数随风飞去</text><text for="L71">期许的崭新自己 纠缠在横纵交错的线网</text><text for="L72">发呆出神 沉入自我世界</text><text for="L73">哪怕任性孤僻 也是无愧于心的我</text><text for="L74">早不放在心上 决绝扬长而去</text><text for="L75">且由他们欢聚高歌故人同窗会</text><text for="L76">依偎在我身旁 自然舒展心怀</text><text for="L77">敛藏心绪的盛大空欢喜</text><text for="L78">咬牙维持的点滴绩点 全都飘散无踪</text><text for="L79">那个想要成为的自我 不再受困于纷繁的线杆</text><text for="L80">茫然静思 痴心沉醉其中</text><text for="L81">哪怕不合群 这样的我也弥足珍贵</text><text for="L82">「辛苦您了 稍微有些着凉感冒」</text><text for="L83">究竟是戏谑玩笑还是真情实意 实在无从参透的难题</text><text for="L84">言不由衷的应答与飞来横祸 同样令人生厌</text><text for="L85">独步长夜 沉溺于清冷的孤寂</text><text for="L86">与身着奇装睡衣的行人格外巧合地撞上目光</text><text for="L87">只愿让这般纯粹的光景再漫长一些</text><text for="L88">即便如此 漫漫夜路依然容易受凉伤风啊</text><text for="L89">总是一味揪出旁人的短处不放</text><text for="L90">挑三拣四 却将自身过失高高束之阁上</text><text for="L91">身心便这般步步走向干瘪颓败</text><text for="L92">眼下的我 还远配不上那样自傲的身份</text><text for="L93">这世间原就没有什么是绝对断言的</text><text for="L94">唯一能够笃定的 唯有不断告诫自己的初心</text><text for="L95">我仍能捧腹大笑在地上打滚 直到肋骨都笑得发痛折断</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Inside Joke"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Inside Joke - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1570795403"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO02101873"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:16.108" end="4:11.108"><p begin="0:16.108" end="0:17.963" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.108" end="0:16.820">思</span><span begin="0:16.820" end="0:16.945">い</span><span begin="0:16.945" end="0:17.143">通</span><span begin="0:17.143" end="0:17.352">りに</span><span begin="0:17.352" end="0:17.963">起きれない</span></p><p begin="0:17.973" end="0:20.052" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.973" end="0:18.478">急</span><span begin="0:18.478" end="0:18.769">いで</span><span begin="0:18.769" end="0:19.211">飲み込む</span><span begin="0:19.211" end="0:20.052">納豆巻き</span></p><p begin="0:20.062" end="0:22.563" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.062" end="0:20.315">当</span><span begin="0:20.315" end="0:20.571">たり</span><span begin="0:20.571" end="0:20.867">障</span><span begin="0:20.867" end="0:21.197">りのない</span><span begin="0:21.197" end="0:21.785">儀式</span><span begin="0:21.872" end="0:22.049">み</span><span begin="0:22.049" end="0:22.563">たいな</span></p><p begin="0:22.574" end="0:23.641" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.574" end="0:22.987">お世話</span><span begin="0:22.987" end="0:23.130">に</span><span begin="0:23.130" end="0:23.641">なってます</span></p><p begin="0:23.651" end="0:25.384" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.651" end="0:24.247">手帳</span><span begin="0:24.247" end="0:24.782">開くと</span><span begin="0:24.876" end="0:25.159">もう</span><span begin="0:25.159" end="0:25.384">過去</span></p><p begin="0:25.394" end="0:27.262" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.394" end="0:26.002">先輩</span><span begin="0:26.002" end="0:26.116">に</span><span begin="0:26.116" end="0:26.766">追い越せない</span><span begin="0:26.766" end="0:27.115">論破</span><span begin="0:27.115" end="0:27.262">と</span></p><p begin="0:27.372" end="0:30.708" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.372" end="0:27.774">明</span><span begin="0:27.774" end="0:27.874">る</span><span begin="0:27.874" end="0:28.113">日も</span><span begin="0:28.113" end="0:28.610">来る日も</span> <span begin="0:28.610" end="0:29.151">道草</span><span begin="0:29.206" end="0:29.507">食って</span><span begin="0:29.507" end="0:29.806">帰</span><span begin="0:29.806" end="0:29.989">るが</span><span begin="0:29.989" end="0:30.708">贅沢</span></p><p begin="0:30.837" end="0:34.518" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.837" end="0:31.305">もう</span><span begin="0:31.305" end="0:31.741">ダンス</span><span begin="0:31.741" end="0:32.207">ダンス</span><span begin="0:32.207" end="0:32.655">ダンス</span> <span begin="0:32.655" end="0:33.137">誰</span><span begin="0:33.137" end="0:33.407">も</span><span begin="0:33.407" end="0:34.105">気づいて</span><span begin="0:34.105" end="0:34.518">ない</span></p><p begin="0:34.528" end="0:38.190" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.528" end="0:35.430">ジェメオス</span><span begin="0:35.430" end="0:36.176">よりも</span><span begin="0:36.176" end="0:36.798">ゆうもわな</span><span begin="0:36.798" end="0:37.262">落</span><span begin="0:37.262" end="0:37.731">書き</span><span begin="0:37.731" end="0:38.190">に</span></p><p begin="0:38.200" end="0:41.832" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.200" end="0:38.666">もう</span><span begin="0:38.666" end="0:39.098">ステイ</span><span begin="0:39.098" end="0:39.498">ステイ</span><span begin="0:39.498" end="0:39.965">捨てる</span> <span begin="0:39.965" end="0:40.437">下</span><span begin="0:40.437" end="0:40.933">積み</span><span begin="0:40.933" end="0:41.832">正義</span></p><p begin="0:41.842" end="0:47.206" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.842" end="0:42.630">嫌味</span><span begin="0:42.630" end="0:42.802">に</span><span begin="0:42.802" end="0:42.999">費</span><span begin="0:42.999" end="0:43.682">やすほど</span><span begin="0:43.682" end="0:44.183">人生</span><span begin="0:44.183" end="0:44.634">長</span><span begin="0:44.634" end="0:44.866">く</span><span begin="0:44.866" end="0:45.300">ない</span><span begin="0:45.300" end="0:47.206">の</span></p><p begin="0:49.599" end="0:51.286" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.599" end="0:50.561">どうでもいいから</span><span begin="0:50.561" end="0:51.002">置いてっ</span><span begin="0:51.002" end="0:51.286">た</span></p><p begin="0:51.396" end="0:53.224" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.396" end="0:51.929">あいつら</span><span begin="0:51.929" end="0:52.395">全員</span><span begin="0:52.395" end="0:52.827">同窓</span><span begin="0:52.827" end="0:53.224">会</span></p><p begin="0:53.224" end="0:55.100" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.224" end="0:54.153">ステンバイミー</span><span begin="0:54.153" end="0:54.548">自然</span><span begin="0:54.548" end="0:54.951">体</span><span begin="0:54.951" end="0:55.100">に</span></p><p begin="0:55.100" end="0:56.765" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.100" end="0:55.398">シャイ</span><span begin="0:55.398" end="0:55.607">な</span><span begin="0:55.607" end="0:56.041">空</span><span begin="0:56.041" end="0:56.524">騒</span><span begin="0:56.524" end="0:56.765">ぎ</span></p><p begin="0:56.955" end="0:58.602" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.955" end="0:57.413">ねばった</span><span begin="0:57.413" end="0:57.854">戦績</span> <span begin="0:57.854" end="0:58.321">飛んでっ</span><span begin="0:58.321" end="0:58.602">た</span></p><p begin="0:58.812" end="1:00.676" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.812" end="0:59.267">なりたい</span><span begin="0:59.267" end="0:59.730">自分に</span><span begin="0:59.730" end="0:59.965">絡</span><span begin="0:59.965" end="1:00.199">まる</span><span begin="1:00.199" end="1:00.676">電柱</span></p><p begin="1:00.686" end="1:02.348" itun